Z||000000||Fierochic88||07-29-2001||08:49 PM||||Hey All!  For those of you who didn't make it to Maple Grove today you missed one fun time!  We had nearly 20 Fieros there today.  Vonnie Houck (Veronica's86GT), Jerry Beck, John Scones, Matt McGowan and Joe Rebilas (FieroGT914) and myself were all in stock.  Dave Horst (Skitime) Denny Lambert (Denny), Bob Schlag (Gargoyle), Bill Patterson and Jason Haughey (Fiero38) were all in modified.  Bill (NOS3800)& Earl Sessions, John Titus, Keith Gerhard and Jason Haughey all ran cars as well.  It was neat to see the show cars and then go watch our group race.  Not sure how John ended up in the brackets but Jason and Earl both had impressive runs in the low 13's.  Vonnie got third in Stock, SkiTime got 3rd in modified along with a tie with Denny against some impressive cars.  There were also some cool Firebirds that did awesome wheel stands and the JEGS cars were also there!  It was soooo cool!<P>Jennifer<P><P>------------------<BR>IM Username:  FieroChic88<BR>Silver 1988 GT<BR>Silver 1986 2m4<BR>Cobalt Blue 85 GT<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/jenscar-sig1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Denny||07-29-2001||09:22 PM||||Nice summary, Jen!<P>I had a great time! It was really nice seeing all of our Fiero crowd, plus some of the other Pontiac folks I've met and gotten to know over the years.<P>The racing was outstanding! And John won Bracket III!<P>I have a few photos I'll post this week.<P>Thanks to all for coming!||||reg||14
